  "details": "The Meta Quest Pro headset is not so weak, and has the most important and most expensive function for a social game - face and eye tracking. There are a lot of users of the native version of VRChat, I think it will be unpleasant to lose such a cool and expensive function on the native version of the game. I'd really like to wait for the implementation of built-in face and eye tracking. I don’t know how possible this is, but I know that this is a very difficult task. Let this feature be available to exclusive users, such as VRC+ subscribers",
